From: Firmware Security Follow-up <security@local.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] bpf zero extend arena cmpxchg

CVE: CVE-2026-98049
Upstream-Status: Backport [https://git.kernel.org/linus/4814ed6406f3493bd554ad046da5f7fc04833571]

Instruction fixup helper remains in verifier.c. BPF_PROBE_ATOMIC and ARM64 arena atomic support are already present.

--- a/kernel/bpf/verifier.c
+++ b/kernel/bpf/verifier.c
@@ -609,7 +609,8 @@
 static bool is_cmpxchg_insn(const struct bpf_insn *insn)
 {
 	return BPF_CLASS(insn->code) == BPF_STX &&
-	       BPF_MODE(insn->code) == BPF_ATOMIC &&
+	       (BPF_MODE(insn->code) == BPF_ATOMIC ||
+		BPF_MODE(insn->code) == BPF_PROBE_ATOMIC) &&
 	       insn->imm == BPF_CMPXCHG;
 }
 
